#: desktop.cc:754
msgid ""
"Could not logout properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace. Note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Kunn nich richtig afmellen.\n"
"Kunn den Törnpleger nich tofaat kriegen. Du kannst probeern, den Reekner "
"mit Strg+Alt+Rücktast uttomaken. Wahrscho, de aktuelle Törn warrt nich "
"sekert, wenn Du den Reekner so utmaakst."

